<!-- Layouts: this page sits inside layouts/main.som, and puts a button in the bar with a section -->
state saved = 0

<view>
  <som-section name="actions">
    <button class="primary sm" @click="saved++">Save{saved ? ' (' + saved + ')' : ''}</button>
  </som-section>

  <h1>Layouts</h1>
  <p class="lead">A layout is a <code>.som</code> file in <code>layouts/</code> with a <code>&lt;slot&gt;</code> where the page goes. The bar and the menu around this page are <code>layouts/main.som</code>.</p>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Which layout a page gets</h2>
    <div class="scroll">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Where</th><th>What you write</th><th>Here</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Every page</td><td><code>Som.router(\{ layout: 'main', routes })</code></td><td>this page, Basics, Forms…</td></tr>
        <tr><td>One route and its children</td><td><code>\{ path: '/docs', …, layout: 'plain' }</code></td><td><som-link to="/docs">Docs</som-link></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Inside the page file</td><td><code>layout plain</code></td><td><som-link to="/">Start</som-link></td></tr>
        <tr><td>No layout</td><td><code>layout: false</code> or <code>layout none</code></td><td><som-link to="/print">Print</som-link></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    </div>
    <p class="muted note">The route wins over the page file, and the page file over the router. Going from page to page with the same layout keeps it: the menu doesn't flicker and keeps its state.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Sections: <code>@section</code> and <code>@yield</code></h2>
    <p>The <strong>Save</strong> button at the top right is part of this page, shown in the bar. Press it: the count is this page's state.</p>
    <pre>&lt;!-- layouts/main.som, or a component in it --&gt;
&lt;som-yield name="actions"&gt;shown when the page has none&lt;/som-yield&gt;

&lt;!-- pages/Layouts.som --&gt;
&lt;som-section name="actions"&gt;
  &lt;button class="primary sm" @click="saved++"&gt;Save&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/som-section&gt;</pre>
    <p class="muted">Leave the page and the button goes with it.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>A layout file</h2>
    <pre>&lt;!-- layouts/main.som --&gt;
state menuOpen = false

&lt;view&gt;
  &lt;site-header&gt;&lt;/site-header&gt;
  &lt;nav&gt;…&lt;/nav&gt;
  &lt;main&gt;
    &lt;slot&gt;&lt;/slot&gt;          &lt;!-- the page --&gt;
  &lt;/main&gt;
&lt;/view&gt;</pre>
  </section>
</view>

<style scoped>
table { margin: 4px 0 12px; }
td:first-child { font-weight: 500; }
.scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
table { min-width: 560px; }
.note { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; }
</style>
